# core/hello

The smallest module a repository can hold

## Where it is built

minimal

## What it exchanges

Nothing: it neither provides nor requires.

## What it declares to install

| Family | Packages | Enabled repository |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `fedora` | `fastfetch` | `updates-testing` |
| `fedora` | `example-tool` | `copr:copr.fedorainfracloud.org:example:tools` |

| Family | Groups | Enabled repository |
